msgstr "引荐客户正式委托有证据可查的咖啡店无障碍标示。完成约定工作才有收入，认识 Lee 本身不会带来收入。"

#: data/story/personal/sofia.json
msgid "A referred client commissions a documented account fee comparison. Complete the agreed work; no revenue is earned merely for knowing Sofia."
msgstr "引荐客户正式委托有证据可查的帐户费用比较。完成约定工作才有收入，认识 Sofia 本身不会带来收入。"

#: data/story/personal/frank_doyle.json
msgid "A referred client commissions a documented auction condition disclosure. Complete the agreed work; no revenue is earned merely for knowing Frank Doyle."
msgstr "引荐客户正式委托有证据可查的拍卖车况揭露。完成约定工作才有收入，认识 Frank Doyle 本身不会带来收入。"

#: data/story/personal/harbor_point.json
