msgstr "引荐客户正式委托有证据可查的新手运动课表。完成约定工作才有收入，认识 Rosa · Harbor Point Fitness 本身不会带来收入。"

#: data/story/personal/ms_okoro.json
msgid "A referred client commissions a documented community energy questions. Complete the agreed work; no revenue is earned merely for knowing Ms. Okoro."
msgstr "引荐客户正式委托有证据可查的社区能源问题集。完成约定工作才有收入，认识 Ms. Okoro 本身不会带来收入。"

#: data/story/personal/ruiz.json
msgid "A referred client commissions a documented construction handover checklist. Complete the agreed work; no revenue is earned merely for knowing Ruiz Construction."
msgstr "引荐客户正式委托有证据可查的工程交付核对表。完成约定工作才有收入，认识 Ruiz Construction 本身不会带来收入。"

