#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "EXW: buyer collects. FOB: seller loads the vessel. CIF: seller also pays main freight and required insurance, but risk still passes at loading. DDP: seller covers arrival duty and risk until buyer delivery."
msgstr "EXW 由买方提货；FOB 由卖方负责装船；CIF 由卖方再付主运费及必要保险，但风险仍在装船时转移；DDP 由卖方付进口税，并承担送达买方前的风险。"

