#: data/dialogue/lina_rails.json
msgid "It costs 0.6 percent, fifteen dollars minimum. If the goods never come, the contract sends your money back. Nobody has to trust anybody's promise."
msgstr "费用百分之零点六，最低十五美元。货要是一直没到，合约会把钱退给你。没有人需要相信谁的承诺。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It costs a fee and about a day. Order early, so the delay does not leave your shelves empty."
msgstr "要付一笔费用，也要多等大约一天。早点下单，才不会因为延迟让货架空着。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It costs a little profit, but can cover payroll or rent when cash is tight."
msgstr "少赚一点，但现金紧的时候可以撑过发薪日或缴房租。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It frees your hours for other work, but the weekly wage is due whether or not a run pays. Margins are thin, so it only pays with enough runs on the board."
msgstr "你的时间可以拿去做别的事，但不管有没有单，每周的薪水都要付。利润很薄，外送单够多才划算。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is an operating cost, like rent. Build it into your prices, especially as you grow."
msgstr "它跟房租一样是营运成本。要算进定价里，公司越大越要注意。"

#: data/events/hotel_equipment_failure.json
msgid "It is cheaper, but the affected rooms are off sale for six days."
msgstr "比较便宜，但受影响的房间会停售六天。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is due every month whether the van moves or not, so a van that sits idle still costs you money."
msgstr "不管货车有没有在跑，每个月都要缴，所以停着不动的货车照样花你的钱。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is much cheaper per parcel, but the driving is your time. For a small batch, or when you are busy, a courier can still be the better deal."
msgstr "每件包裹便宜很多，但开车的时间是你的。件数少、或你很忙的时候，快递还是可能比较划算。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It is still yours on paper, but you cannot spend it. Keep enough cash outside any single payment route to run the business while it is stuck."
msgstr "帐面上还是你的，但你不能动用。单一付款管道以外，要留够现金，才撑得过钱被卡住的这段时间。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It moves profit between segments, not into the group. The consolidated totals cancel it out, so only real savings versus buying outside count."
msgstr "它只在分部之间移动利润，不会增加集团利润。合并报表会把它冲销，只有相对外购省下的成本才算数。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_rails.json
msgid "It runs on software, and software has bugs. My contract has been audited twice. I'd still say: don't put more in it than you can live without for a week."
msgstr "它是靠软件跑的，软件会有漏洞。我的合约审计过两次，我还是要说：放进去的钱，最好是你就算一周动不了也没关系的。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "It shows what your business is worth today, and why both profit and cash matter."
msgstr "它告诉你事业今天值多少，也说明为什么获利和现金都重要。"

#: scripts/sim/logistics.gd:482
msgid "It was late, so the pay was cut."
msgstr "这单迟到了，所以报酬被扣。"

