msgid "The board-approved team grant transfers existing shares. It creates no revenue or personal payout."
msgstr "董事会核准把现有股份分给团队，不会添加营收，也不会让创办人拿到现金。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "The boxes are stuck at sea."
msgstr "货卡在海上。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "The brand breakdown comes from actual company activity. Events fade over 90 days, while current reviews and employee conditions still matter."
msgstr "品牌明细来自公司的实际活动。事件影响会在 90 天内消退，现有评价和员工状况仍会影响分数。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The bridge is frozen"
msgstr "跨链桥冻结了"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:151
msgid "The bridge is frozen until %s."
msgstr "跨链桥冻结，预计 %s 恢复。"

