msgid "The bridge is open again, with limits and an insurance pool. Wires never stopped, so you lost nothing but a week of options. Split your payments across rails, and keep a wire route warm."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了，有限额，也有保险基金。电汇从没停过，你只是少了一周的选择，没有损失。付款要分散在不同管道，电汇这条路也要维持畅通。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:385
msgid "The bridge is open again."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:387
msgid "The bridge is open again. Frozen balances came back at %d cents on the dollar: %s of your %s. The attacker drained the rest before the freeze. The operators' reserve and insurance pool covered everyone else's share, and nobody covers the gap."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。冻结的余额按 %d%% 返还：你的 %s 拿回 %s。其余的在冻结前就被黑客搬走了。营运方的准备金和保险基金补了大家的份，缺口没有人负责。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:257 scripts/sim/rails.gd:315
msgid "The bridge isn't frozen."
msgstr "跨链桥没有冻结。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:384
msgid "The bridge reopened. Frozen balances came back at %s on the dollar."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。冻结的余额以 %s 的比例返还。"

#: data/events/rail_frozen.json
msgid "The bridge under our rail was exploited. Transfers crossing it are frozen."
msgstr "我们管道底下的跨链桥被骇了，经过它的转帐全被冻结。"

